      "side": 1,
      "message": "Fedora, and by extension, RHEL, CentOS, Rocky, has/have a policy that all python scripts with a shebang use\n  #! /usr/bin/python3 ...\nsee [1]\n\nrpm builds in Fedora Koji, and CentOS and Rocky build systems do post-processing on the shebangs.\n\nThere are incompatible differences, e.g. between python-3.9 and python-3.14, and we only guarantee — to the extent we guarantee anything — that the scripts work with the default python.",
      "revId": "6157815161ae7fe4c59617516e08028abe6dfd86",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
