      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1010265
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-15T09:41:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "well, we do use site packages, and they only have one version. The patch solves this problem. A user may switch the default python to a different version (usually a newer version) - that is supported by the distros?",
      "parentUuid": "8c5581c0_d7c66bd3",
      "revId": "6157815161ae7fe4c59617516e08028abe6dfd86",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
